## 🟢 Public / Frontend-Facing

| Variable | Required Format | Examples |
|----------|-----------------|----------|
| `CLOUDFRONT_URL` | Full HTTPS URL | `https://cdn.example.com` |
| `FRONTEND_URL` | Full HTTPS URL | `https://app.example.com` |
| `APP_URL` | Full HTTPS URL | `https://example.com` |
| `STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY` | `pk_live_` or `pk_test_` followed by 24 hex chars | `REDACTED_STRIPE_PK_LIVE...` |
| `PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID` | 16-25 alphanumeric characters | `A2A4J2KQUL3V9T` |
| `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID` | 10-20 digits (as per App Engine: `client_` + GUID) | `123456789012.apps.googleusercontent.com` |

**Validation:**
